<title>POLAND: Polish min T-bill prices fall at tender.</title>
<headline>Polish min T-bill prices fall at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minimum prices of all Polish T-bills fell at Monday's primary auction on total demand of 1.08 billion zlotys against a 1.1 billion zloty offer, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>The ministry sold T-bills worth 842 million zlotys.</p>
<p>It will stage its next primary T-bill tender, again offering 1.1 billion zlotys, on Monday, July 28.  </p>
<p> T-bill	    8-week  13-week  26-week  39-week  52-week</p>
<p> new min price   96.72    94.78    89.95     ---     81.67</p>
<p> (pvs auction)  (96.85)  (94.86)  (90.03)    ---    (81.80)</p>
<p> new max price   97.27    94.95    90.10     ---     81.82</p>
<p> (pvs auction)  (96.90)  (94.98)  (90.12)    ---    (81.91)</p>
